In order to receive this license, you must agree to its rules. The rules of this license are both obligations under that agreement and conditions to your license. You must not do anything with this software that triggers a rule that you cannot or will not follow.

## 2. Commercial Use Restriction

You may not use this software for any commercial purpose. Examples of commercial purpose include:

- Running the software to provide a paid service or commercial SaaS.
- Selling or licensing copies of the software.
- Bundling the software with commercial products or services.
- Using the software as part of revenue-generating commercial operations.

## 3. Permitted Personal & Educational Use

You may run, modify, copy, and distribute this software for noncommercial purposes, such as:

- Personal use for individual reading and study.
- Research, education, and academic evaluation.
- Private personal hosting for your own individual reading needs.

## 4. Third-Party Speech Services Notice

This software interfaces with Microsoft Edge Neural Text-to-Speech endpoints for spoken voice generation. Microsoft Edge TTS is intended for individual personal reading. Any commercial or production business applications require licensing official commercial speech APIs directly (such as Microsoft Azure Speech Services or Google Cloud Text-to-Speech).

